&lt;li&gt;Maintain and manage customizations for NetSuite modules to meet business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain custom fields, records, and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage user roles, permissions, provisioning, access controls and data security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with data import and exports, ensuring data integrity and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommend solutions for systems improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain custom reports, suitelets and dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ongoing support to users, troubleshooting issues and answering questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide user training for user roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up-to-date on NetSuite features, enhancements and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage NetSuite business process improvements, projects and ensure delivery of projects outlined in the NetSuite roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
