&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8 years experience as NetSuite administrator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current NetSuite Certified Administrator qualification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional understanding of NetSuite core functionalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in implementing and configuring NetSuite modules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in creating custom fields, records, and workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical experience with modern API methods, SQL and the development of complex systems at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with NetSuite Suitescript is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and as part of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Agile methodologies and SDLC.&lt;/li&gt;
