&lt;li&gt;Multi-Channel Hunting: Use Outreach, LinkedIn, and cold-calling to break into new accounts and bypass gatekeepers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRM Integrity: Maintain 100% accuracy in Salesforce.com, ensuring lead stages and activity notes are updated in real-time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
