&lt;li&gt;Develop domain expertise and thought leadership regarding Dell’s current areas of focus as well as in new areas for expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and deliver formal and informal technical training sessions for Dell resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain technical expertise on current and developing PPBS products and technology&lt;/li&gt;
